Ashtanga yoga, Mysore self-practise method, causes meditation:

Asana,Drsti,Bandha,Ujjayi - four concurrent physical body control tasks
The mind has four slots for this kind of task
Doing these four tasks fills the mind, which makes it 'stop'

This is the first type of meditation. This type causes the next type:
mediation that happens without four concurrent physical body control tasks

This is a simplified view. Life is always more complex.
